Based originally on sun3_beaksoft.ps but improved quite a lot

At the top of the PostScript file you can change page size and strapline 
text, as well as grid spacing.

render with GhostScript:
./bin/gs -dBATCH -dNOPAUSE -sDEVICE=pdfwrite -r1200 -sOutputFile=mousepad.pdf sun3_beaksoft.ps 

print it with:
lp -d EPSON_WF_3620_Series -o cupsPrintQuality=High mousepad.pdf

Remember to let the ink dry or it smudge!

Enjoy

